a-spacing-mini\\\"> <li class=\\\"a-spacing-mini\\\"><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> Set of 4 dandelion garden spikes in 2 different designs: 2 pieces with heart shaped flower head and 2 pieces with round flower head, original and detailed design for a varied garden decoration. </span></li> <li class=\\\"a-spacing-mini\\\"><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> HIGH QUALITY IRON WITH DURABLE AGED LOOK - Made with heavy duty iron, pre-rusted and absolutely weather resistant; sun and wind create a beautiful natural patina for timeless vintage charm. </span></li> <li class=\\\"a-spacing-mini\\\"><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> Realistic Dandelion Motif: Detailed metal dandelions symbolize hope and freedom, integrate harmoniously into any garden style and bring beautiful accents in pots and flower beds. </span></li> <li class=\\\"a-spacing-mini\\\"><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> SIMPLE USE WITHOUT ASSEMBLY: The garden spikes are ready to use, no assembly or tools required, just lock them in the soil, flower beds or pots and decorate. </span></li> <li class=\\\"a-spacing-mini\\\"><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\"> Versatile outdoor applications: ideal for garden, lawn, flower bed, terrace, balcony and flower pots; suitable as a year-round environmental decoration and as a loving gift for gardeners and nature lovers. </span></li> </ul> <div id=\\\"product-details-jumplink\\\" class=\\\"a-section\\\"> <span class=\\\"caretnext\\\">›</span> <a id=\\\"seeMoreDetailsLink\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"#productDetails\\\"> See more product details </a> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\\\"sustZoneATF_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"celwidget\\\" data-feature-name=\\\"sustZoneATF\\\" data-csa-c-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-csa-c-content-id=\\\"sustZoneATF\\\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\\\"sustZoneATF_feature_div\\\" data-csa-c-asin=\\\"B0GS1TW9G5\\\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\\\"false\\\" data-cel-widget=\\\"sustZoneATF_feature_div\\\"> </div> <div id=\\\"provenanceCertificatio"}